PRO FORMA FIRST BOARD RESOLUTION

WHEREAS the Corporation has been incorporated pursuant to the Business Corporations Act (Alberta);

RESOLVED that the Corporation subscribe for and issue the initial shares as set out in the Articles of Incorporation;

RESOLVED that the registered office of the Corporation shall be established at the address specified in the Articles of Incorporation;

RESOLVED that the following persons be appointed as the initial directors and officers of the Corporation with full authority to manage the business: [Director Name], [Officer Name] as President, [Officer Name] as Secretary, [Officer Name] as Treasurer;

RESOLVED that the Corporation's initial by-laws be adopted as presented and that the officers be authorized to execute all documents on behalf of the Corporation.

This resolution was passed unanimously by the board of directors on the date hereof.
